-- Six citizens, two enum columns: Faction is who they side with, Loot what they carry. Assignment under a mask overwrites the selected cells with the :Name constant and leaves the rest alone.
-- Faction and Loot are distinct enum spaces that share codes numerically; sym columns keep the name spaces separate.
--! registry ../registries/017-assignment.reg
--! expect faction = Friendly Hostile Friendly Hostile Hostile Friendly
--! expect loot = Empty Gems Coins Empty Coins Gems

Bandit , Faction = :Hostile
Dead , Loot = :Empty
